OL,3,GNEWSAM8 closed in both directions in
OL,4,ARenfrewshire after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommuters are facing diversions and
OL,7,Flong tailbacks after an overnight crash
OL,8,Fled to the closure of the M8 in
OL,9,FRenfrewshire.
OL,11,FPolice said a collision was reported at
OL,12,Fabout 23:45 on Sunday between junction
OL,13,F29 near Paisley and junction 30, just
OL,14,Fwest of Glasgow Airport.
OL,16,FEmergency teams remain in attendance,
OL,17,Fwith drivers advised to find
OL,18,Falternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
