OL,3,GNEWSAM8 closed in both directions in
OL,4,ARenfrewshire after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe closure is causing difficulties for
OL,7,Fdrivers with some using the Erskine
OL,8,FBridge as a diversion route or
OL,9,Ftravelling on smaller roads through
OL,10,FErskine, and queues could lead to
OL,11,Fdelays reaching the airport.
